    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Ottawa Miniature Gallery (OMG) is a mobile gallery showcasing a diverse selection of miniature art from local artists in public and accessible spaces around the city. The OMG brings together artists who work in various media over the shared joy of making something small.\n\nThe Ottawa Miniature Gallery is partnering with the National Arts Centre to present miniature artworks created by 2SLGBTQI+ identifying artists living in the National Capital Region. As part of the OMG’s commitment to making a big..."
      }
    ],
